          "example": "DLQ_mqtest",
          "help_en": "The dead-letter topic.\n\nIf a message fails to be consumed after the maximum number of retries, the message is sent to a dead-letter topic. You can then perform business recovery or trace the message. For more information, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/440356.html",
          "help_zh": "死信Topic。\n\n消费者出现异常消费某条消息失败，且消息重试后依然未成功，消息将被投递至死信Topic中，以便后续进行业务恢复或回溯。更多信息，请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/440356.html",
          "name": "dead_letter_target_topic",
          "options": [
            "--dead-letter-target-topic"
          ],
          "raw_name": "deadLetterTargetTopic",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "example": "10",
          "help_en": "The fixed retry interval. Unit: seconds. This parameter is valid only if you set the retryPolicy parameter to FixedRetryPolicy.\nValue range:\n\nConcurrent delivery: 10 to 1800\n\nOrderly delivery: 1 to 600",
          "help_zh": "固定重试间隔，单位：秒。重试策略为FixedRetryPolicy固定间隔重试策略时生效\n取值范围：\n并发投递：10-1800\n顺序投递：1-600",
          "name": "fixed_interval_retry_time",
          "options": [
            "--fixed-interval-retry-time"
          ],
          "raw_name": "fixedIntervalRetryTime",
          "required": false,
          "type": "int"
        },
        {
          "example": "16",
          "help_en": "The maximum number of retries",
          "help_zh": "最大重试次数",
          "name": "max_retry_times",
          "options": [
            "--max-retry-times"
          ],
          "raw_name": "maxRetryTimes",
          "required": false,
          "type": "int"
        },
        {
          "enum": [
            "DefaultRetryPolicy",
            "FixedRetryPolicy"
          ],
          "example": "DefaultRetryPolicy",
          "help_en": "The retry policy. For more information, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/440356.html.\n\nValid values:\n\nFixedRetryPolicy: fixed interval retry. This policy applies only to orderly messages.\n\nDefaultRetryPolicy: backoff retry. This policy applies only to concurrent messages",
          "help_zh": "重试策略类型。更多信息，请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/440356.html。\n\n参数取值如下：\nFixedRetryPolicy：固定间隔重试，仅支持顺序投递\nDefaultRetryPolicy：阶梯退避重试，仅支持并发投递",
          "name": "retry_policy",
          "options": [
            "--retry-policy"
          ],
          "raw_name": "retryPolicy",
          "required": true,
          "type": "string"
        }
